 ('colour','Colour','locked','Stone, sea and hearth.','Use the approved palette by role. Language does not determine colour.','Approved palette','',['Ink for reading; laterite for restrained emphasis.','Rules are decorative, not text colours.','Night colours need their own contrast check.']),
 ('type','Typography','locked','Three scripts, equal care.','Cormorant Garamond 500 for English display; Source Serif 4 for English reading; Noto Serif Oriya for Odia; Tiro Devanagari Hindi 400 for Hindi.','Approved families','',['Check conjuncts and vowel marks.','Use natural Indic character spacing.','Preserve poet names and original line breaks.']),
 ('paper','Paper & atmosphere','locked','A quiet surface beneath the words.','Cotton paper for general pages; stable monsoon or earth wash for poems. No texture in night reading.','Cotton paper','Poem wash',['Cotton at 16%; poem wash at 18%, softened on phones.','Atmosphere must never compete with the text.','Art stays still.']),
 ('spacing','Spacing & rhythm','pending','How much room should a poem have?','Choose a default rhythm for related content. Preserve optical adjustments for Odia and long titles.','Unhurried · recommended','Compact editorial',['Compare 48px and 32px between major content groups.','Both use the same 4–64px spacing scale.','Review the phone preview before approving.']),
 ('openings','Page openings','pending','An invitation before the reading begins.','The approved 60% text / 40% artwork split remains. Compare supporting copy and vertical rhythm.','Short introduction · recommended','Title-led opening',['One clear page purpose and action.','Artwork changes by page family.','Both versions stack on small screens.']),
 ('navigation','Navigation','pending','A clear way in, and a clear way back.','Retain the shared masthead and single-line desktop footer. Choose the mobile menu treatment.','Plain stacked links · recommended','Two-column menu',['Try Menu with keyboard and touch.','Current page has a visible label.','Footer links remain together and left-aligned on phones.']),
 ('reader','Poem reading','pending','Let the words set the pace.','Compare a single-line reading toolbar with grouped controls. Try all three scripts, enlargement and night reading.','Quiet toolbar · recommended','Grouped controls',['Keep authored lines and stanza spacing.','Large text must wrap without clipping.','Night reading and text-size controls must announce their state.']),
 ('actions','Buttons & links','pending','One clear action, without shouting.','Compare square and gently softened buttons. Both keep a filled primary action, outlined secondary action and underlined text links.','Square editorial · recommended','Soft corners',['Inspect default, hover, focus and disabled examples.','Primary controls have a 48px minimum target.','External links keep the quiet directional mark.']),
 ('cards','Cards & metadata','pending','A poem, a poet, a place in the journal.','Compare open cards with a fine rule against pale-paper panels. Test long titles and native names.','Open editorial · recommended','Pale-paper panels',['Keep title, poet, issue and language in a consistent order.','Use real cover art without crowding it.','Whole-card links must not swallow secondary actions.']),
