 ('feedback','Messages & recovery','pending','Kind words when something needs attention.','Compare a quiet margin rule with a pale-paper panel for success, error, loading and empty states.','Margin rule · recommended','Pale-paper panel',['Use wording as well as colour.','Give errors an actionable next step.','Loading, unavailable and empty results are different states.']),
 ('search','Search & filters','pending','A word can lead somewhere.','Compare underlined language choices with filled selected filters. Search the three preview poems and try a no-result query.','Underlined choices · recommended','Filled selection',['Filters belong near results, never in the masthead.','Announce the result count.','Clear filters must restore the complete sample list.']),
 ('sharing','Sharing & dialogs','pending','Let a poem travel with its poet.','Compare a compact share dialog with one that includes an artwork preview. Both preserve title, poet and original link.','Words first · recommended','With artwork',['Try opening, Escape, closing and focus return.','Copy only reports success after clipboard permission succeeds.','External publishing is not performed by the sample.']),
 ('imagery','Artwork & portraits','pending','A cultural narrative, with room to breathe.','Compare a soft watercolour edge with a clean rectangular crop. Examine banner, cover and portrait treatment together.','Soft edge · recommended','Clean crop',['Preserve faces and important focal points.','Do not invent documentary provenance.','Credits live in the colophon; meaningful titles remain.']),
 ('ornament','Rules & small marks','pending','A small pause between thoughts.','Keep the approved header separator. Compare a plain section rule with the existing flowing waterline for occasional editorial transitions.','Fine rule · recommended','Occasional waterline',['Do not place ornamental dividers above and below the same heading.','Use the end mark once per poem.','External marks remain quieter than their link text.']),
